1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,430
This is Watch Me.

2
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:05,259
It listens only when you ask it to, and it only answers to your voice.

3
00:00:06,599 --> 00:00:11,167
In a recent lawsuit, a student said she felt like bait at a fraternity party, and that she had been drugged.

4
00:00:11,167 --> 00:00:12,056
The case is disputed.

5
00:00:12,056 --> 00:00:14,255
Someone who's been drugged can't say they're not OK.

6
00:00:14,255 --> 00:00:16,919
And at school or at work, harassment often hides inside a joke.

7
00:00:18,519 --> 00:00:20,677
First, she reads three short lines.

8
00:00:20,677 --> 00:00:25,115
Watch Me turns her voice into a voiceprint, drawn here as a fingerprint.

9
00:00:25,115 --> 00:00:29,799
From now on, only this voice can start Watch Me, stop it, or answer, I'm OK.

10
00:00:40,119 --> 00:00:42,159
At a party, she says: watch me.

11
00:01:09,219 --> 00:01:10,059
She answers, no.

12
00:01:10,059 --> 00:01:12,054
In her voice, that means she's not OK.

13
00:01:12,054 --> 00:01:16,567
So Watch Me texts and calls the people she chose, with what it heard and where she is.

14
00:01:16,567 --> 00:01:17,459
Here, in dry run.

15
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:30,048
Now someone grabs her phone and says, stop watching.

16
00:01:30,048 --> 00:01:31,117
It isn't her voice.

17
00:01:31,117 --> 00:01:34,440
Watch Me refuses, keeps recording, and asks her right away.

18
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:42,251
Not all harassment is an emergency.

19
00:01:42,251 --> 00:01:44,606
At office hours, she switches to Notice mode.

20
00:01:44,606 --> 00:01:46,020
Nothing will interrupt her.

21
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:14,292
When she stops, Muse Wonder shows which exact words match how the EEOC describes harassment.

22
00:02:14,292 --> 00:02:15,218
Strings attached.

23
00:02:15,218 --> 00:02:16,198
Getting her alone.

24
00:02:16,198 --> 00:02:17,560
It never decides for her.

25
00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:18,737
And it counts patterns.

26
00:02:18,737 --> 00:02:23,740
This is the third time from the same professor, kept in a dated record that shows if anyone changes it.

27
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:27,114
Under the hood, every agent has its own model.

28
00:02:27,114 --> 00:02:29,229
Whisper and a voiceprint on the device.

29
00:02:29,229 --> 00:02:32,321
Muse Spark as the live analyst, and again as the decider.

30
00:02:32,321 --> 00:02:36,171
Muse Wonder for reviews, and Muse Voice Transcribe for spoken accounts.

31
00:02:36,171 --> 00:02:41,594
On 22 realistic scenes, it asked in nine of eleven harmful ones, with no needless check-ins.

32
00:02:41,594 --> 00:02:45,120
On forty public training cases, the reviewer got all forty right.

33
00:02:46,819 --> 00:02:47,312
Watch Me.

34
00:02:47,312 --> 00:02:48,133
You turn it on.

35
00:02:48,133 --> 00:02:49,719
Only your voice turns it off.

36
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:51,579
And only you decide what happened.

